FROM C:\Users\admin\gemma4-turbo-family\gemma4-12b-iq4xs-mmproj.gguf
TEMPLATE {{ .Prompt }}
SYSTEM Gemma 4 Turbo 12b is the balanced performance edition of the Gemma 4 Turbo family — Google's encoder-free 12B parameter model, optimized for CPU via turboquant inference tuning with KV cache quantization (Stage 1 TurboQuant). Delivers the best balance of speed, capability, and memory usage in the family, with native multimodal support for text, images, and audio. No GPU required.
RENDERER gemma4
PARSER gemma4
PARAMETER num_batch 512
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER num_thread 8
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
PARAMETER temperature 0.75
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
